Career technical education equipment and
HB0235
supplies.
Sponsored By: Representative(s) Andrew, Bear, Campbell, K,
Erickson, Lawley, Neiman, Strock, Williams and Wylie
and Senator(s) Boner, Brennan, Crum, Driskill, Hicks,
Kolb and Scott
AN ACT relating to public school finance; modifying resources provided through
the education resource block grant model for career technical education
equipment and supplies; requiring resources generated for career technical
education supplies, materials and equipment be expended as specified; creating
a categorical grant for career technical education supplies, materials and
equipment; making conforming amendments; making technical corrections;
repealing provisions; appropriating funds; and providing for an effective date.
